                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term3_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Le numéro de commande doit être inscrit sur toutes les factures afin d'effectuer le paiement.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term4" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term4_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>4.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term4_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Le terme de paiement, est strictement de 30 jours après la livraison, sauf accord contraire conformément à l'accord contractuel signé.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term5" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term5_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>5.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term5_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Guarantie: Lorsqu' une garantie est applicable, la documentation nécessaire doit accompagner les biens ou les services. Sinon, par défaut, les éléments couverts par ce bon  seront garanties pour 18 mois à compter de la date de l'offre ou de 12 mois à compter de la date d'installation / mise en service.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term6" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term6_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>6.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term6_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Tous les autres certificats réglementaires à l'exemple de la Fiche de données de Sécurité (FDS), les Manuels d'Utilisation, de traitement des dechets etc., doivent être actuels et doivent accompagner ce bon de commande.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term7" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term7_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>7.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term7_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Les marchandises et / ou services ne seront acceptés que s'ils sont conformes à nos standards de  qualités et / ou à nos  spécifications standards.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term8" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term8_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>8.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term8_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>La facture doit être établie sur la base de la plus faible quantité entre celle du pont bascule du fournisseur principal et celle du pont bascule de Dangote.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term9" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term9_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>9.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term9_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Toutes les factures doivent être envoyées au Département des finances.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
               <subform layout="position" minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term10" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/></border>
                  <draw h="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term10_n" w="0.55cm" x="0.25cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>10.</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="middle"/>
                  </draw>
                  <draw minH="0.5cm" name="folder4_F_term10_t" w="18.1cm" x="0.85cm" y="0cm">
                     <value><text>Aucune modification de ces termes et conditions ne sera acceptée.&#10;</text></value>
                     <font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                     <para vAlign="top"/>
                  </draw>
               </subform>
            </subform>
            <subform layout="tb" name="s_close" w="19cm">
               <bind match="none"/>
               <subform h="0.45cm" layout="position" name="s_cl_blank1" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_blank1_c" w="19cm" x="0cm" y="0cm"><border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
               </subform>
               <subform h="0.45cm" layout="position" name="s_cl_blank2" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_blank2_c" w="19cm" x="0cm" y="0cm"><border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
               </subform>
               <subform h="0.45cm" layout="position" name="s_cl_blank3" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_blank3_c" w="19cm" x="0cm" y="0cm"><border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
               </subform>
               <subform h="0.45cm" layout="position" name="s_cl_sign" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_sign_1" w="6.33cm" x="0cm" y="0cm"><border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_sign_3" w="6.34cm" x="12.66cm" y="0cm"><border><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
               </subform>
               <subform h="0.45cm" layout="position" name="s_cl_last" w="19cm">
                  <bind match="none"/>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_last_1" w="5cm" x="0cm" y="0cm"><border><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/></border></draw>
                  <draw h="0.45cm" name="s_cl_last_2" w="14cm" x="5cm" y="0cm"><border><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/><edge thickness="0.26mm"/></border></draw>
               </subform>
            </subform>
         </subform>
      </subform>
